        689,
        1273,
        757
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is in the best interest of the people of The City of New York that health care policy and the delivery of health services be closely coordinated among the various departments and agencies providing those services; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2482,
