        982
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a72. *Functions, Powers and Duties*\u2014The general purpose of the Inter-Agency Health Council is to provide maximum coordination of health services for the people of this City, and without limiting the foregoing, it is empowered and directed to:",
      "logprob_stats": {
