    {
      "bbox": [
        402,
        1217,
        1275,
        1396
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a73. *Members*\u2014Members of the Inter-Agency Health Council shall be the First Deputy Mayor, the Commissioner of Health, the Commissioner of Mental Health and Mental Retardation Services, the Commissioner of the Addiction Services Agency, the Commissioner of Social Services and the Director of the Comprehensive Health Planning Agency, all of whom shall serve ex-officio. The Health and Hospital's Corporation is requested to participate by designating its President as a member. The members of the Council shall have the power to exercise or delegate any of the functions, powers and duties vested in them by this Order.",
      "logprob_stats": {
