        1399,
        1275,
        1466
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a74. *Chairman*\u2014The Commissioner of Health shall be the Chairman of the Inter-Agency Health Council for the first full calendar year. The chairmanship will thereafter rotate among the membership in accordance with rules the Council adopts.",
