    {
      "bbox": [
        402,
        1470,
        1275,
        1602
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a75. *Committees*\u2014The Inter-Agency Health Council may create such committees as it shall deem appropriate. The Chairman shall appoint members of committees and committee chairmen who need not be members of the Inter-Agency Health Council, subject to the approval of the members of such Council. The chairman may select from the member departments and agencies, such personnel as may be necessary to staff the committees, with the consent of the respective heads of such departments and agencies.",
